If your child has written the June 21st re-exam and is anxious about missing out on a state government seat due to cutoffs pushing beyond 650+, you must realize that the road to becoming a doctor does not end at the Indian border. 

To protect your child's career from commission-driven agents, you should read our comprehensive [Kolhapur & Pune Agent Scams Guide](/intelligence/best-study-abroad-overseas-education-consultants-kolhapur-scams-guide) and verify compliance pathways via our [NMC Approved Colleges List Scam Audit](/intelligence/the-nmc-approved-colleges-list-scam-how-to-legally-verify-compliance). In this comprehensive guide, we bypass the emotional noise and lay out a strategic, legal roadmap. We will demonstrate how crossing the basic NEET qualification line on June 21st is all your child needs to unlock world-class, affordable, and fully NMC-compliant medical programs in the heart of Europe.

